---
layout: base.njk
title: 信号流存档
permalink: /signals/
---

<h1 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">📡 副业灵感信号流</h1>
<p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
  每日快报层的全部信号存档：独立项目、AI 工具、开源商机、国内灵感——不止深度项目，所有发现都留档可检索。
</p>

{% set grouped = collections.signals | groupByDate %}
{% if grouped.length %}
{% for day in grouped %}
<div class="archives-year">
  <h2>📅 {{ day.date }}（{{ day.items[0].data.signals.length }} 条信号）</h2>
  {% for signal in day.items[0].data.signals %}
  <div class="signal-entry">
    {% if signal.category %}<span class="signal-cat signal-cat-{{ signal.category | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ signal.category }}</span>{% endif %}
    <h3>{{ signal.title }}</h3>
    {% if signal.summary %}<p class="signal-summary">{{ signal.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="signal-meta">
      {% if signal.replicable %}<span class="signal-replicable">{{ signal.replicable }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if signal.source %}<span class="signal-source">来源：{{ signal.source }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if signal.sourceUrl %}<a href="{{ signal.sourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文 →</a>{% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<p style="color: var(--muted);">还没有信号存档。从今天开始，每日快报的信号会出现在这里。</p>
{% endif %}
